        <detaileddescription>
<para>Testing finite volume projection calculations for the underpinning stencils.</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>get model and compute pressure gradients</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>verify (for the interior elements only) that the flux balance is indeed zero using established approach</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>verify face by face computations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>verify flux balance cell-by-cell</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>verify overall flux balances for hybrid element mesh</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>compare computation times for flux balances </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
